.probe/
# One stage's scratch: throwaway scripts, the token file they read, dev-server logs. A scratch probe is
# written as .ts, .mts, .mjs or .cjs depending on which loader the directory is under, so the pattern
# covers the family rather than one extension.
api/scripts/tmp-*
api/tmp-*
tmp-*.log
